<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-HANSA ASSET PLANS LATVIA, LITHUANIA OFFICES.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-HANSA ASSET PLANS LATVIA, LITHUANIA OFFICES.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hansa Asset Management said on Thursday that it has applied to open an office in Latvia and was also planning to start operations in Lithuania.</p>
<p>The firm's managing director Raul Malmstein told Reuters that he was expecting to hear whether the Latvian office would be registered this week.</p>
<p>&quot;I think that in the coming weeks we can start (business),&quot; Malmstein said.</p>
</text>
